<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Medjay</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Medjay were a people of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eastern-desert">Eastern Desert</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nubia">Nubia</a>, known from Egyptian texts from the Old Kingdom onwards. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/middle-francia">Middle Kingdom</a> they served as scouts and auxiliaries for the Egyptian army and are associated with the archaeological Pan-Grave culture. By the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-kingdom-of-egypt">New Kingdom</a> the name had come to mean an Egyptian desert police force.</p></div>
